  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The de-facto standard for modern healthcare interoperability. Mandated by CMS and ONC in the US, referenced in EU EHR interoperability guidelines, and adopted globally. Multiple mature open-source implementations exist (HAPI FHIR, Blaze, Medplum, Azure Health Data Services). Use R4 for new work; R5 is emerging but R4 has far wider ecosystem support.",
